# Raw per-match records from scripts/roster-sim.mjs — tens of MB per run, and fully
# reproducible from a seed (`npm run sim -- --games 16000 --difficulty hard`). The fitted
# output that the docs actually cite (analysis*.json, kit-audit.json) IS committed, so the
# numbers in BALANCE.md and MATCHUPS.md can be checked without re-running the simulation.
sim-*.json
*.tmp
